      "description": "Tech Lead for the External Data Service team\n- Provide technical direction and architectural design for a full-stack distributed microservice. On top of feature delivery, worked on issues including service scaling, API design, cost, and maintainability. \n- Works closely with stakeholders and partner teams to align on priorities and breakdown work\n- Mentor and provide career growth opportunities for software engineers in lower cohorts. \n- Improved the team's architecture review process, resulting in smoother communication with collaborating teams and fewer meetings \n- Worked with Terraform, Java, Springboot, React, Flyway, and various AWS technologies",
