      "totalDuration": "5 yrs 5 mos",
      "description": "Note Field Microservice\n- Designed and built a React note field microservice to migrate the codebase from monolith architecture to microservice architecture. \n- Implemented functionality such integration with third-party speech-to-text solutions, text substitution macros, and HTML serialization/deserialization.\n- Built a spellcheck microservice in AWS, using AWS Lambda to update the medical dictionary.\n- Directed a team of 4+ remote contractors in India to replace old Perl/Javascript note fields with the new microservice.\n\nFast Healthcare Interoperability Resources API\n- Exposed complex healthcare data in RESTful APIs to meet government interoperability requirements. \n\nTelehealth\n- Built an integrated telehealth microservice and took the product to GA. Uses React and Amazon Chime. \n",
